   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "**Two shots that continue each other**\n\n1. **Multi-Shot Prompt** times the shots, **Camera & Lens** sets the look.\n2. Clip 1 (Seedance) hands its **last_frame** to clip 2 (Wan 3.0) as the first frame.\n3. Press **Run**. Both clips play on the right.\n\nTo start from your own still, connect a **Load Image** node to clip 1's **first_frame**. Swap models, shots and presets freely. Only generated video is charged."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "**Two shots that continue each other**\n\n1. In **Load Image**, pick your still. **Multi-Shot Prompt** writes a timed prompt (2 s + 3 s) and **Camera & Lens** adds the look.\n2. Clip 1 runs on Seedance. Its **last_frame** feeds clip 2 as the first frame, so the scene continues on Wan 3.0.\n3. Press **Run**. Both clips play on the right.\n\nSwap models, shots and presets freely. Only generated video is charged."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
